{
    "title": "Aiuta \u2013 AI Stylist",
    "description": "Aiuta AI Stylist: Elevate Your Style Effortlessly\r\nMeet Aiuta, the fashion-tech app built on cutting-edge AI that takes your style to the next level. With Aiuta, you can express your personality through fashion, virtually try on new outfits, discover inspiration ideas, get feedback from AI stylists, and feel confident about what you wear.\r\n\r\nBuild Your Outfit Gallery\r\nEffortlessly create stunning outfits with ease. Dress up and create your own outfit gallery to showcase your unique personal style. Whether it\u2019s casual, formal, or anything in between, Aiuta helps you create your very own lookbook for every occasion.\r\n\r\nDiscover Style Ideas for Every Outfit\r\nExplore new styling options to perfect your look. With Aiuta, you can discover endless style ideas and alternatives for every outfit, helping you enhance your wardrobe with confidence.\r\n\r\nTry on the Latest Trends Virtually\r\nExperiment with diverse brands and styles by virtually trying on outfits. Take a selfie, upload a photo, and see how different fashion items look on you without leaving your home. Enjoy the fun and convenience of virtual try-ons to find your perfect style.\r\n\r\nBuild your own looks\r\nTell our AI Stylist what you want to wear, and watch it create the perfect visualisation of your thoughts in seconds.\r\n\r\nAchieve a Perfectly Organised Wardrobe (Coming Soon)\r\nAiuta AI organises, categorises, and saves your wardrobe items. Say goodbye to the frustration of not knowing what to wear. Our app helps you keep track of your clothing and accessories, making it easier to plan and coordinate your outfits. This feature will be available soon.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\nVirtual Try-on: Upload a photo and virtually try on outfits to discover new trends and experiment with your look.\r\nAI Stylist Opinion: Get professional opinions from AI stylists to guide you on how to elevate your style\r\nOrganised Wardrobe: Save, categorise, and manage your wardrobe items efficiently (Coming Soon).\r\nOur research shows that 74% of women have items they\u2019ve never worn in their wardrobe. Impulsive buying wastes your money and the planet\u2019s resources. Whether shopping online or in-store, Aiuta is with you, helping you make rational buying decisions so you choose the items that you truly love. Aiuta aims to eliminate \u201cI\u2019ve got nothing to wear\u201d or \u201cI don\u2019t know if this suits me\u201d moments and help you feel empowered to dress confidently.\r\nDiscover and showcase your unique personal style with our innovative clothing style app! Dress up and create stunning outfits with ease using our extensive collection of fashion items. Elevate your daily look and become a trendsetter with our interactive fashion app.\r\nImmerse yourself in a one-of-a-kind shopping experience with our digital style experts. Discover a curated selection of fashion items and gain access to inspiring content that will ignite your creativity. Aiuta is designed to save you time and mental energy, allowing you to stay focused on reaching your goals. \r\nFor more information, visit our website: www.aiuta.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Aiuta AI Stylist: Elevate Your Style Effortlessly<br>Meet Aiuta, the fashion-tech app built on cutting-edge AI that takes your style to the next level. With Aiuta, you can express your personality through fashion, virtually try on new outfits, discover inspiration ideas, get feedback from AI stylists, and feel confident about what you wear.<br><br>Build Your Outfit Gallery<br>Effortlessly create stunning outfits with ease. Dress up and create your own outfit gallery to showcase your unique personal style. Whether it\u2019s casual, formal, or anything in between, Aiuta helps you create your very own lookbook for every occasion.<br><br>Discover Style Ideas for Every Outfit<br>Explore new styling options to perfect your look. With Aiuta, you can discover endless style ideas and alternatives for every outfit, helping you enhance your wardrobe with confidence.<br><br>Try on the Latest Trends Virtually<br>Experiment with diverse brands and styles by virtually trying on outfits. Take a selfie, upload a photo, and see how different fashion items look on you without leaving your home. Enjoy the fun and convenience of virtual try-ons to find your perfect style.<br><br>Build your own looks<br>Tell our AI Stylist what you want to wear, and watch it create the perfect visualisation of your thoughts in seconds.<br><br>Achieve a Perfectly Organised Wardrobe (Coming Soon)<br>Aiuta AI organises, categorises, and saves your wardrobe items. Say goodbye to the frustration of not knowing what to wear. Our app helps you keep track of your clothing and accessories, making it easier to plan and coordinate your outfits. This feature will be available soon.<br><br>Key Features:<br>Virtual Try-on: Upload a photo and virtually try on outfits to discover new trends and experiment with your look.<br>AI Stylist Opinion: Get professional opinions from AI stylists to guide you on how to elevate your style<br>Organised Wardrobe: Save, categorise, and manage your wardrobe items efficiently (Coming Soon).<br>Our research shows that 74% of women have items they\u2019ve never worn in their wardrobe. Impulsive buying wastes your money and the planet\u2019s resources. Whether shopping online or in-store, Aiuta is with you, helping you make rational buying decisions so you choose the items that you truly love. Aiuta aims to eliminate \u201cI\u2019ve got nothing to wear\u201d or \u201cI don\u2019t know if this suits me\u201d moments and help you feel empowered to dress confidently.<br>Discover and showcase your unique personal style with our innovative clothing style app! Dress up and create stunning outfits with ease using our extensive collection of fashion items. Elevate your daily look and become a trendsetter with our interactive fashion app.<br>Immerse yourself in a one-of-a-kind shopping experience with our digital style experts. Discover a curated selection of fashion items and gain access to inspiring content that will ignite your creativity. Aiuta is designed to save you time and mental energy, allowing you to stay focused on reaching your goals. <br>For more information, visit our website: www.aiuta.com",
